<p>System (black box) requirements. Each requirement declares a <tt class="docutils literal">COVERS</tt>
relation to every <tt class="docutils literal">RULE</tt> it addresses.</p>
<p>These four requirements cover three clauses out of the 93 that
<tt class="docutils literal">Eurobot_Rules.sdoc</tt> holds, so the Traceability Matrix shows a long list
of rules nobody has written a requirement for yet. Working that list down
is the course's own job.</p>
<p>The rules are in Russian and the requirements are in English, because the
rules are quoted from the competition documents while the requirements are
the course's own writing.</p>
